# S26: demo1 (e1m3) from 12.8 s, Classic at 320x200 with the status bar and the gun: the
# gibs burst at about 14 s. id's recorded camera and its sound. The five lines of text
# over it (SOUND: SAMPLE FOR SAMPLE, 28 OF 28; FRAME BY FRAME: 17,500 FRAMES; CAMERA,
# EVERY ENTITY and EVERY DYNAMIC LIGHT, each ticked) are the edit's art, in Quake's
# lettering on dark bands at the 4:3 box's top right, each brought in on its word; they
# are not part of the shot. The edit plays it slowed a little, to run under both lines.
#
# Under V3-17a, "The mixer matches id's, sample for sample.", and V3-17b, "Demo playback
# matches frame by frame: the camera, every entity, every dynamic light."

demo demo1 from 11.8

duration 8.6
fps 60
size 1920x1080

preset classic
mode 320x200
hud on
gun on
cvar gamma 0.75

sound on
events on
